# Rendered audio is DERIVED. The score is the source, the renderer is
# deterministic, and `sound render` reproduces any of this byte for byte --
# so committing WAVs would be committing build output, and a 15 MB binary
# that changes whenever a note changes is the fastest way to make a repo
# unreviewable. Goldens, when they arrive, go in test/golden/ and are the
# one deliberate exception.
audio/
node_modules/
*.wav
*.mp3
!test/golden/*.wav
site/
